ion": "Drift V \ud83c\udfc1\ud83d\udd25\nBECOME A DRIFT LEGEND IN THE WORLD\u2019S MOST IMMERSIVE VR DRIFTING SIMULATION!\n\nStrap into the ultimate adrenaline rush built exclusively for Meta Quest. With hyper-realistic physics, 9 FREE high-performance drift cars, and 12 levels of tire-shredding action, Drift V transforms your living room into a global drifting arena.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 9 FREE CARS \u2013 Unlock & master hyper-realistic drift machines!\n\ud83c\udf00 12 LEVELS OF SIDEWAYS ACTION!\n\n\u2705 TRUE-TO-LIFE PHYSICS:\n- Feel every tire scream, counter-steer, and weight shift in VR!\n- AI drivers with pro-level drift skills \u2013 battle them for dominance!\n\n\ud83c\udfac CINEMATIC THRILLS: Epic cutscenes celebrate your biggest drifts!\n\ud83c\udfae META QUEST OPTIMIZED: Intuitive controls, smooth locomotion, zero motion sickness!\n\n#VRDrift #DriftingGame #MetaQuest #VRCars #RacingSim #AdrenalineRush\n\n\ud83d\udc49 GRAB THE WHEEL!\nOnly on Meta Horizon Store\nSearch: \ud83d\udd0e \u201cDrift V\u201d\n\nQuest 2/3/Pro | Comfort: Comfortable\n\nYOUR DRIFT LEGEND STARTS NOW! \ud83d\udca8\ud83c\udf1f", "short_description": "Drift V \ud83c\udfc1\ud83d\udd25\nBECOME A DRIFT LEGEND!\nStrap into Meta Quest\u2019s ultimate VR drifting sim! Master 9 FREE cars across 12 adrenaline-fueled levels.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 FREE DREAM CARS\n\ud83c\udf00 12 SIDEWAYS LEVELS\n\n\u2705 TRUE-TO-LIFE PHYSICS\n- FEEL every tire scream & weight shift!\n- Battle pro-level AI drift rivals!\n\n\ud83c\udfac EPIC CUTSCENES\n\ud83c\udfae COMFORT-FOCUSED: Smooth controls, zero nausea!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/driftv/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ascendrix Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/driftv/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "